// A static method takes no visibility: 'Public Static Method' is "C2003
// Syntax Error" (so are 'Static Public Method' and 'Public Method ...
// Static'); 'Static Method' is taken, and its implementation may say
// 'Static' too (tried on 24.3.1.9).
Class Calc
  Public Static Method Soma(a, b)
  Static Method Dobro(n)
EndClass

Method Soma(a, b) Class Calc
Return a + b

Static Method Dobro(n) Class Calc
Return n * 2

User Function Calcula()
Return Calc():Soma(1, 2) + Calc():Dobro(3)
